	(text "ICHG = 890/3.3k = 270 mA\nUSB500: EN1=1, EN2=0\n-> IIN <= 500 mA\nTS: TH1 10k NTC (B3435), R8 10k DNP\nCharge window 0.5..50.8 C (see NOTES)\nTMR open: 5 h timer"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 191.77 68.7 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "22adaef0-8005-5da9-8393-8f7fa90e5e41")
	)
	(text "NOTES"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 160.65 182.88 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2.54 2.54)
				(thickness 0.3175)
				(bold yes)
				(color 90 90 90 1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "37d8c981-f9a5-5116-8642-eb4376268d6a")
	)
	(text "BRING-UP\nSleep current: replace R13 (0R, LDO_OUT to\n+3V3) with an ammeter. Include the e-paper\nboost path in the measurement.\nTest pads: VBUS, VBAT, VSYS, +3V3, GND."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 244.38 191.61 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.65 1.65)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "38fb95b3-6a8e-5638-8f92-fb1e102f622f")
	)
	(text "PULL-UPS / PULL-DOWNS\nEPD_CS_N, EPD_RST_N: 100k to +3V3 keep the\npanel idle while the MCU sleeps.\nIO15: 10k to +3V3 (strap). If JTAG_SEL is\nburned, selects USB Serial/JTAG, not pad JTAG."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 244.38 231.61 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.65 1.65)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "44fa1d1c-2cdc-5e64-b5cd-d03617ed6751")
	)
	(text "USB-C INPUT + ESD"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 13.97 13.97 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2.54 2.54)
				(thickness 0.3175)
				(bold yes)
				(color 0 132 80 1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "475c7771-f85a-56d2-a951-33df6c161099")
	)
	(text "PROGRAMMING (J4 pads)\n+3V3, GND, EN, IO9/BOOT, TXD0, RXD0.\n2x3 pads at 2.54 mm: pogo clip or header.\nHold BOOT low, pulse EN for download mode.\nPin 1 (+3V3) is sense/reference only: do not\nfeed 3.3 V with no battery fitted (RT9080\nback-feed)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 161.92 208.61 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.65 1.65)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "49127a2f-4122-53ba-a24e-952bf8b00c50")
	)
	(text "U3 pin 9 (marking\narea) is not a pad.\nKeepout and F.Mask\nopening: footprint.\nLayout: only each\npad's own trace may\nenter the band under\nthe body."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 216.11 148.36 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "4a3ee895-25de-5330-b27a-0499dc51498e")
	)
	(text "LP GPIO (IO0-IO4 wake):\nIO0 BAT_ALRT_N\nIO1 USB_PGOOD_N\nIO2 BTN_N\nIO3 ACC_INT1\nIO4 BARO_INT\nIO5 LED_USER\nIO6/7 LP_I2C\nIO8 10k pull-up"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 15.24 93.36 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "569088d0-4c15-5e5f-a9b2-1d94d6b0f16b")
	)
	(text "J2 pin 2 = BAT+\nJ2 pin 1 = BAT-\nQ2 blocks a reversed\ncell. Silkscreen:\nmark + and -"
